This method is a great way to *keep* the vocab once you have learned  
it. I've used a couple of the Pimsleur (sp?) method audio CD's, from  
which  the setup was borrowed, and found them all very good.

And I love to see any new learning material for lojban. Like his  
learnfast program, lower down on the screen:

http://coirodo.com/english/

mu'omi'e aleks

